WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:03.180
- [Narrator] You're about an
hour and a half into the movie

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.380
and boy are you regretting
that large soda.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.853
You can hold it, sure, but should you?

00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:16.200
Peeing is pretty important.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.800
Your kidneys filter excess water
and waste out of your blood

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.830
and that urine needs
somewhere to go, your bladder.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.640
Normally, it will hold one
to two cups comfortably

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.350
but if you make a habit
out of holding your pee

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.200
for long periods of time,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.870
you can actually stretch your bladder

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.780
to easily hold even more.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.320
One study found that nurses
who often held it in all day

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.430
due to job constraints had nearly double

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.340
the normal bladder capacity

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.080
and turns out they were totally fine

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.730
but that doesn't mean
that you should hold it in

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:52.660
if you can help it

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.680
'cause your bladder might not
be the only thing to stretch.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:02.230
You may also stretch your
external sphincter muscles.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.620
Those are important muscles

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.800
connected to the outside of your bladder

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.303
that are the gatekeepers
of your golden liquid.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.940
Clench them and you hold in the gold.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.820
Relax them and you release the flow

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.790
but if you overstretch them,
you can actually lose control.

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.450
This is rare and it usually takes decades

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.150
of holding it in too
long to reach that point

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:29.020
but once you do, it can
lead to some awkward

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.190
and even dangerous situations.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.310
For example, with less overall control,

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:38.410
you risk leaking urine
when your bladder is full

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.673
and not emptying it all the
way when you finally do go.

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:46.570
Not only can this increase
your need to urinate more often

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.670
since your bladder fills up quicker,

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.980
it can also lead to a serious disorder

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.030
called urinary retention

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.680
where you end up with too much urine

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.030
in your bladder for too long

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.240
and since your bladder
is basically a warm,

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.350
wet bag of body waste,

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.540
it's the perfect breeding
ground for harmful bacteria

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:07.800
that will cause all sorts of damage.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.530
Even worse, if you're really unlucky

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.503
and retain too much urine, it
may back up into your kidneys.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.283
This can cause kidney
failure and ultimately death.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.700
The good news is you're more likely

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.160
to just lose control
of your muscles and pee

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.033
way before your bladder hits this point.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:30.120
Why not reduce the risk altogether

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.033
and just go to the bathroom?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:37.490
Okay, I get it, the movie
is absolutely gripping.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.150
Luckily, you'll be fine
if you only hold it in

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.833
for a short time every once in a while.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:46.830
So go ahead, hang in there.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.823
Just don't make a habit of it.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.130
Any other weird science
questions you have?

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.753
Ask us in the comments.

00:03:00.127 --> 00:03:02.460
(screaming)

